(72, 'BH', 'Spain', 1909, 'Beistegui Hermanos - The company was founded in 1909 to produce firearms and in 1919, after World War I, BH began making bicycles. BH is in Vitoria-Gasteiz, capital of the Basque Country.', 'https://www.bhbikes.com/'),
